{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "496e54cad4cf280798edc3180a886326c9879ea5a6cf4dff4d93f863495e65fa", "ja": "トゥインクル☆リリーの悩み", "zh": "闪亮☆莉莉的烦恼", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e30d2cb7fa74656f00c36aff4081bb225934debbc7126219a9d16baf5ffe045a", "ja": "憧れの魔法少女になれたリリーだったが、\n現実の壁は高い…。いっそ冥府に堕ちようと\n思いつめるリリー。しかしぴーちゃんの\nアドバイスにより、リリーの目は輝きを\n取り戻すのだった。", "zh": "莉莉虽然当上憧憬许久的魔法少女，\n但现实的阻碍太过巨大……\n走投无路的莉莉甚至想干脆堕入冥府。\n幸好有小哔的建言，\n让莉莉的眼神重新恢复光芒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "61b929178f1e1c16d7f093a4267a4eab0866581f8017d862cc548083bf9e92cf", "ja": "（百合子と一緒に、劇場に戻ってきた。\nなんだか思い詰めた顔をしているな……）", "zh": "（我和百合子一起回到剧场。\n她看起来心事重重……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "22501eadc9300dcbb99553c4a26862502f453333e69e658dd55b977dc98a9ee4", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\n私、私……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n我、我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1002_p", "source_sha256": "bc3b098c99622b7d0506135279c451027f88de029df81d5d8ac781659c7e1d81", "ja": "うん……どうした？", "zh": "嗯……你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "dfcec20afc89b6874c9da6d2c90c977e75862c7cc1debf0b0e0087fbb09f6b21", "ja": "私……やっぱり運動神経が悪くって……。", "zh": "我……我真的很没有运动细胞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "dbbe75dcabcd1ab58fa6d3e745e5cdc27396f65a048cdadf7fe0dd2e5926588e", "ja": "普通のダンスは、今までも私なりに……\n頑張ってきたつもり、だったんですけど……。", "zh": "如果是一般的舞蹈，我觉得自己一直以来……\n都有尽力达到要求……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "015a566ff5e81da4ba5a992830076e5b42a8caf085e110a4f8cf0ebcbc3b794e", "ja": "でも今回は、どうしても……うう～っ！", "zh": "但这次无论怎么努力都……呜呜～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0da937eb1675b7192b160cd51d8377824af31f5de2f004fe6a3e66acfb144e49", "ja": "お、落ち着くんだ百合子！\nとりあえず焦らないで、話を聞かせてくれ。な？", "zh": "冷、冷静点，百合子！\n你先别急，慢慢跟我说，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "7bfe6f7f6e104605dceb65b18e73d5c6dfba47e5eefb1f90dcbfb82f5918959f", "ja": "は、はい……ごめんなさい……。ぐすっ。", "zh": "好、好的……对不起……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1008_p", "source_sha256": "81e8c061aa608955897cc5698b6cb15a58cd8fa9f30266b1877d00a1b3296c9a", "ja": "（……百合子の悩みは、やはり\n『トゥインクルリズム』のことだった）", "zh": "（……百合子的烦恼\n果然跟『闪亮节奏』有关。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "25726b5cc494e6f35d9b89a55f8524d32c45a9a6ad74275743c7db446a8207e4", "ja": "初めて台本を読んだ時は、私……とっても心がときめき\nました……。魔法少女って、ずっと憧れてましたし。", "zh": "一开始看到剧本时，我感到……心花怒放……\n因为我一直都很憧憬魔法少女。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1010_p", "source_sha256": "40c29d6de2182d4e761e3819f4daa3121609f38b7926de244370824abefb2911", "ja": "そうだよな。俺もこの仕事、\n百合子は適役だと思ったんだ。", "zh": "是啊，我也觉得这份工作\n很适合百合子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "7f1b24f661192335564bf6702eaa689c8a68104badfe0e18e4441f358f55eec3", "ja": "ありがとうございます……。私も、絶対成功させよう\nって思ったんですよ！　それで何度もイメトレして……", "zh": "谢谢……我也下定决心一定要把戏拍好！\n所以不断地靠想像力训练……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "a24a8746a3ff451813b4622b072fa5d5cd01ec87e2fdaf053e3240c32d38912c", "ja": "想像の中で魔法少女に変身した私は、なんでもできま\nした。空だって自由に飛び回ったり！　でも……。", "zh": "我想像自己变身成魔法少女，无所不能。\n还能在天空自由翱翔！但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1013_p", "source_sha256": "1606f5dcaa562efac118507f8e7a20fcfd7197bc77985c60a0b66e1111b6d9c9", "ja": "……でも、現実では思うように身体が動かない。\nつまり、アクションがうまくできない……ってことか？", "zh": "……但是，你在现实中的身体却跟不上想像的动作。\n也就是说，你在武打动作的训练并不顺利……是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "710d6e631f73cb2939e015d8b9198520cba516012e6353069ef785b4988d5c73", "ja": "！　どうして私の心が読めるんですか！？　まさか\n{$P$}さんに魔法少女の力が……！", "zh": "啊！为什么你知道我在想什么呢！？难道说，\n{$P$}先生有魔法少女的力量……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f3b5a5664e82eaaa8864eba4e3394f866c75f5e33a15f706f63001a2a9378e2d", "ja": "ないない。まあ、わかるよ。\nアクションは、最初から百合子の課題だったからな。", "zh": "你想太多了。这我当然知道啊，\n毕竟百合子的课题原本就是武打动作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "ba23b708789e2b0a8fe3b36afd2a45a6cfba0cea2ccf3f2ede10e41a6fffd054", "ja": "うう、そうなんです……。初めてのことばっかりで、\n何度練習しても、上手くいかなくって……。", "zh": "呜呜，对啊……好多事情我都没有学过，\n不管再怎么练习都没有起色……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "5d2d6de2f9da71ee46a4514dd44fb12b86b68e32d810d8ddcb8f09255fc0977e", "ja": "こうなったら、漆黒の冥府に堕ちるしかありません！\n私、悪魔と契約して最強の魔法少女になりますっ！！", "zh": "既然如此，我只能堕入漆黑的冥府了！\n我要和恶魔结下契约，成为最强的魔法少女！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1018_p", "source_sha256": "009ef518df8986f2155c87762de3979cf409720966c916cc4dabefd415a708ce", "ja": "あっ、待て！\n戻ってくるんだ百合子！　百合子ー！", "zh": "啊，等等！\n回来啊，百合子！百合子──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "aa430f3969453ff929867980b2de00d2945a57c6c4fed7697a5d33d1d8c00850", "ja": "きゃっ！？", "zh": "呀！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1020_026yur", "source_sha256": "62a7db0d5d63827394325c0a8ab1861c4a423dc52b56fc6b4fc2c6db470de943", "ja": "あっ！　春香さんっ！？　ご、ごめんなさい。……私は\n冥府を探すことにしました。探さないでください～！", "zh": "啊！春香！？对、对不起……\n我要去找冥府了，请别来找我～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1021_001har", "source_sha256": "016c7ed45869ad51533142eb0b7ea020cd4acf7611858e7745a0dbd98d955740", "ja": "ええっ！？　どうしたの百合子ちゃん！\nちょっとまって～！！", "zh": "咦咦！？你怎么了？百合子！？\n等一下～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1022_001har", "source_sha256": "cf6e8e259168b9dd9e92c7445313e8eee6cdd0a36f9306238be67493d393f085", "ja": "……そっか。百合子ちゃんは、アクションが\nうまくできなくて悩んでるんだね？", "zh": "……这样啊。百合子，你因为武打动作一直不到位，\n所以很烦恼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "b81b59206cc6e4bb14a525430aa539ce9311bebb21d2d630130f43f23ef3b7a5", "ja": "はい……。冥府も簡単には見つかりそうにないし、\nもう本当にどうしたらいいか……。", "zh": "是的……冥府也没那么容易找到，\n我到底该怎么办才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1024_p", "source_sha256": "743f0914188f1e3025e55511e2536fe8c6bfbf51e415e19c80ed694992593e53", "ja": "なにかいい方法はないか？　\nコツみたいな……。", "zh": "有没有什么好方法呢？\n比方说有什么诀窍……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1025_001har", "source_sha256": "8c4f81d836c1fc16ecdb954bfcbe205ea690506d3cf80351eb8cb6736e3ef740", "ja": "うーん、そうですね。あんまり深く考えたこと\nありませんけど……。あのね、百合子ちゃん。", "zh": "唔～这个嘛。我没仔细想过这种事情，\n不过……百合子，你听我说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1026_001har", "source_sha256": "3504407786251f4f82705fca02faa54d4e7f76d76d2de7e4c377aa7da4dad764", "ja": "私はね、演じたりアクションしたりするお仕事も、\nいつものステージと同じだって思ってるんだ！", "zh": "我觉得呀，不管工作内容是演戏还是武打动作，\n其实都和平时上舞台表演一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1027_026yur", "source_sha256": "7a95f14df309d03fef6cf9801bbd665d56120ed544ef5aa7f1469223a80d5d28", "ja": "いつものステージって……\n歌ったり踊ったりのステージですか？", "zh": "平时的表演……\n你是说唱歌跳舞的表演吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1028_001har", "source_sha256": "45df320536b18e319774457ee5625c69f3f6ee0da891fd6001d31145bd68b514", "ja": "うん！　ステージだと、まず自分の動きを覚えて、\n仲間の動きも覚えるよね。コンビネーションのために。", "zh": "没错！站上在舞台时，首先要记好自己的动作，\n然后也记住伙伴们的动作对吧？这是为了互相搭配。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1029_001har", "source_sha256": "dc403ce7850a78af13609effc8d6c4d91d09e89e05b308686fbcc897a5da0aff", "ja": "それって、演技とかアクションでも同じなのかなって。\n……なんて、先輩ぶっちゃったかな？　えへへ♪", "zh": "所以，我觉得演戏和武打也是一样吧。\n……这样是不是有点倚老卖老啊？嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1030_026yur", "source_sha256": "82b4c021b4d54a8a5e4770b802887c767f082d2e047b70161e9609887ba193d7", "ja": "ダンスのコンビネーション……そっか。\nみんなと息を合わせて、同じリズムに乗って……！", "zh": "舞蹈的搭配……我懂了。\n和大家步调一致，配合大家的节奏……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1031_p", "source_sha256": "59f60a32dbc3588a76123b69d69fa7534526fecda75cbb216ebf375f9e7f9b89", "ja": "なるほど。\nたしかに、同じようなものかもしれないな。", "zh": "原来如此，\n这两者确实很类似。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1032_p", "source_sha256": "092220dd78ffcc1767b53097eefb1bf639559e2c67f877a5fabd2bed6c96d74a", "ja": "お客さんだって、客席にいるか、カメラの向こうに\nいるかの違いでしかないわけだし。", "zh": "观众也一样，只差在一个是在观众席，\n一个是在镜头后面而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1033_026yur", "source_sha256": "ca065154d06d6f1581b00e3630d3d2e02c00b0cc91751cf6be57235ea09ab785", "ja": "カメラの向こうに……客席が……！", "zh": "镜头后面的……观众席……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1034_001har", "source_sha256": "6fc57e18fafd2b670881dc5860ed87854f38e55e906becdc1c6ad4b4ffd356a1", "ja": "……。\nふふっ、百合子ちゃん。もう大丈夫？", "zh": "……呵呵。\n百合子，已经没问题了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1035_026yur", "source_sha256": "0228dc9f052aa75b5fb076883a46965de7f05db6a3a9fc178117664bbabc8a78", "ja": "はい！　{$P$}さん、春香さん……。\n私、もう一度チャレンジしてみます！", "zh": "是！{$P$}先生、春香……\n我想要再挑战一次！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1036_026yur", "source_sha256": "21e3d7be8e208edb9f8d363859d9d5b64c28330da718a4a113da61370fb89fea", "ja": "{$P$}さん、今ってレッスン室、\n空いてますか？　私、何かがつかめそうな気がして！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，现在练习室有人吗？\n我感觉快掌握到诀窍了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1037_p", "source_sha256": "7f0781944a4311434aa45a9e578a51ee7f97e73082e2537a72b55f86580d5d05", "ja": "ああ、今日はもう空いてるみたいだ。\n好きなだけ使っていいぞ！", "zh": "练习室的话，今天应该已经没人要用了。\n你就尽情使用吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1038_001har", "source_sha256": "efd37f5c0cf5e03b9dfe95afcbb9017eb85922b4eadd59174b6a706c5d184a0c", "ja": "それなら、私も一緒にレッスンしてもいいかな？", "zh": "既然这样，我也可以一起去练习吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1039_026yur", "source_sha256": "be3f0944e9564c25d96700e12d4e04a2983dd75eb39a26b252dddfa8d5e878b1", "ja": "えっ、春香さん、いいんですか？\n忙しいんじゃ……。", "zh": "咦？春香，没关系吗？\n你应该很忙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1040_001har", "source_sha256": "57b9c2a41f8b95cb19fcea6869812d9042962bb4505c87a4da8637bda324d8c5", "ja": "ううん、平気だよ。だって……。", "zh": "不会，没关系的。因为……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1041_001har", "source_sha256": "5eec57c3ed046296214b046acfd3115a6265786474e0b636fddad767c474ae26", "ja": "トゥインクルリリーのサポートは、\nこのぴーちゃんにお任せっぴ♪　なーんて！", "zh": "闪亮莉莉就交给我小哔来协助哔♪\n开玩笑的啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1042_026yur", "source_sha256": "084ed212b2bd317921ee08d9a7059d2bf46620ded360b28a93b26fd1f0df4bd3", "ja": "ああっ！　ぴーちゃんだ……！", "zh": "啊啊！是小哔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1043_026yur", "source_sha256": "153e2108153051917bc1d1f4611f4692c83075e570edf7bd6c7eab157ac0e8e3", "ja": "そういえば、ぴーちゃんの本当の名前は、\nトゥインクルスプリングピクシー。その正体は……。", "zh": "这么说来，小哔真正的名字是闪亮春之妖精。\n她的真实身分是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1044_026yur", "source_sha256": "38dc0b908d76bbc510e7bb7d16f19732b17a689a0b9aae06265fde24a2fc3e17", "ja": "人の笑顔と幸せが大好きな、\n鳥の妖精さん、でしたよね！", "zh": "最喜欢看到人们的笑容和幸福的小鸟妖精，\n没错吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1045_001har", "source_sha256": "08fc9306bbf3d0f98e1422f360b3a5722e41a52748a581dd257f0a29c1bb8092", "ja": "さすが百合子ちゃん、ちゃんと設定を覚えてるんだね！\nそう、ぴーちゃんはみんなの笑顔が大好きなんだっぴ♪", "zh": "不愧是百合子，设定都记得很清楚！\n没错，小哔最喜欢看到大家的笑容哔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1046_026yur", "source_sha256": "e1c38ca2cc5d8bc39164c30d2e3184a2e3abdc651539113834b23b26c5e8e4df", "ja": "ぴーちゃ……春香さん！　私、わかった気がします。\nトゥインクルリズムは、みんなで作る物語……。", "zh": "小哔……春香！我好像懂了。\n『闪亮节奏』是大家一起创作的故事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1047_026yur", "source_sha256": "7e6e96e20d415a15935ef149e2596affc8b2541f99340c576fd499b6a14478d3", "ja": "敵役の真さんも、他のキャストさんも入れた、\nみんなで作るステージなんですね！", "zh": "饰演反派的真和其他演员也是一份子，\n这是大家一起创造的表演舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1048_001har", "source_sha256": "a09e1f154d0064091653416dc712a7ac630a82d40b5a5b12a3dfb7514c7c7baf", "ja": "ふふっ、きっとそうだね！\nそれじゃ、早速レッスンで……一緒に頑張るっぴ♪", "zh": "呵呵！一定就像你说的！\n那么，赶快一起……努力练习哔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_04_1049_p", "source_sha256": "9c00f78b2bf6a05a973c37c17f3b8e544d5f2fc6d10e5e8080c791e58d590650", "ja": "（魔法少女の目に輝きが戻った。この調子なら、\n物語というステージに、魔法をかけられそうだ！）", "zh": "（魔法少女的眼神恢复光芒了。就这样保持下去，\n应该也能在这个名为故事的舞台上施展魔法！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
